        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "Here we report the microstructure and mechanical properties of an equiatomic MoReW alloy, which has demanding combination of strength and ductility in the temperature range of 25 °C to 1500 °C. The alloy was prepared by arc melting followed by hot isostatic pressing at 1400 °C, 207 MPa for 5 h and it has a single-phase BCC structure with the average grain size of ~170 μm.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "ae9d8e349db7a218:part:001"
        }
      ]
    }
